# The jam realm's bindings for coax/web/wgsl-module.coax (NAME GROUP BINDING [uniform VEC4FS]), as coax/web/host.js lays
# them out: Splice's (splice-bots.bindings), with group 1 first the private pack's vertices (its storage part), then the
